{"id":2731,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><p>为丰富教职工业余文化生活，增进教师之间的沟通与交流，4月23日下午4点，马克思主义学院工会在学院资料室举办棋类交流活动，学院全体教师积极参与。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=WLmTH7oR62Lm7bLgzG8n7UDMzLaUNnLkLmNsUlr7UzWVnml0gihFp2hmCIa0LYy8LSy4MkybozGiLRVfLzW2M8UYUm-inzlYnmAVUlWVU4MFMmv8LmUsUlQFLznRL4lJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CZLmlJqdMnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6825&e=.jpg\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/34134990501A12F7D2B25E52F8EABEC3/674247AF/14C35\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"520\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=WLmTH7oR62Lm7bLgzG8n7UDMzLaUNnLkLmNsUlr7UzWVnml0gihFp2hmCIa0LYy8LSy4MkybozGiLRVfLzW2M8UYUm-inzlYnmAVUlWVU4MFMmv8LmUsUlQFLznRL4lJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CZLmlJqdMnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6825&e=.jpg\"></p><p>本次活动设有象棋和五子棋两个项目。现场秩序井然，气氛轻松融洽。教师们自由组队，在棋盘上展开对弈。对局过程中，大家不时轻声交流，既切磋棋艺，也分享教学科研中的点滴心得。不论棋局胜负，每位教师都乐在其中，现场不时响起轻松的笑声。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=WUmnHRnzf7L4V7ogl7anR94MRUYLR-L4LRGPL7-8ollsUmN0gihFp2hmCIa0MkyPMYybLkyYMNL4LRWkL7CaM878M7nRnz-bnmM7UzMfLzWFnmQRMNlDozfFLzrfozUJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CZLmlJqdMnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6825&e=.jpg\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/4179026C302B0F07A44DCE29F3DA3A12/F6C6E690/15A94\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"520\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=WUmnHRnzf7L4V7ogl7anR94MRUYLR-L4LRGPL7-8ollsUmN0gihFp2hmCIa0MkyPMYybLkyYMNL4LRWkL7CaM878M7nRnz-bnmM7UzMfLzWFnmQRMNlDozfFLzrfozUJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CZLmlJqdMnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6825&e=.jpg\"></p><p>活动结束后，教师们表示，这样的棋类活动简单有趣，既缓解了工作压力，也拉近了同事之间的距离，希望工会今后能多组织类似活动。学院工会表示，将继续结合教师实际需求，定期开展形式多样的文体活动，更好服务广大教职工，营造积极健康的学院氛围。</p></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://mkszyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=WLmTH7oR62Lm7bLgzG8n7UDMzLaUNnLkLmNsUlr7UzWVnml0gihFp2hmCIa0LYy8LSy4MkybozGiLRVfLzW2M8UYUm-inzlYnmAVUlWVU4MFMmv8LmUsUlQFLznRL4lJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CZLmlJqdMnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6825&e=.jpg"}